<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY OCT PRELIM. TRADE GAP $163MLN - CENBANK.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY OCT PRELIM. TRADE GAP $163MLN - CENBANK.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's trade deficit</p>
<p>amounted to $163 million in October, compared with $166 million</p>
<p>in September, the National Bank of Hungary said in a statement</p>
<p>on Monday.</p>
<p>    ($ million)     Oct 96   Sept 96   Jan-Oct 96  Jan-Sept 95</p>
<p>    Exports	   1,419    1,203	11,515	10,350</p>
<p>    Imports	   1,583    1,370	13,607	12,417</p>
<p>    Trade balance    -163     -166	-2,092	-2,067</p>
<p>NOTE- The central bank's figures are based on cash flows.</p>
<p>October figures are preliminary.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
</text>
